### 测试数据校验

### 1. 正常创建 — 应该成功
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "AirPods Pro", "price": 1899.00, "stock": 200}

### 2. 名称为空 — 应该返回校验错误
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "price": 1899.00, "stock": 200}

### 3. 价格为负 — 应该返回校验错误
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "测试商品", "price": -100, "stock": 200}

### 4. 库存为负 — 应该返回校验错误
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "测试商品", "price": 99.00, "stock": -5}

### 5. 缺少必填字段 — 应该返回校验错误
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "测试商品"}

### 6. 名称太短 — 应该返回校验错误
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "A", "price": 99.00, "stock": 10}

### 7. 正常更新 — 应该成功
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "iPhone 15 Pro", "price": 7999.00, "stock": 50}

### 8. 查询全部
GET http://localhost:8080/products
